{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"ag6VuvNDlZBI903UeQC","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":9,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"九年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)y＝| $\\frac32$ x﹣3|﹣4(2)详见解析(3)1≤x≤4","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5eccb43b2abd365ea81e87b0","queId":"ag6VuvNDlZBI903UeQC","schCode":"3013","textbookId":"5ecc92f2518ec3c65e1e9137"}],"question":"在初中阶段的函数学习中，我们经历了“确定函数的表达式﹣﹣利用函数图象研究其性质一一运用函数解决问题“的学习过程．在画函数图象时，我们通过描点或平移的方法画出了所学的函数图象．同时，我们也学习了绝对值的意义 $\\vert a\\vert=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}a\\left(a\\geq0\\right)\\\\-a\\left(a<0\\right)\\end{array}\\right.$ ．结合上面经历的学习过程，现在来解决下面的问题在函数y＝|kx﹣3|+b中，当x＝2时，y＝﹣4；当x＝0时，y＝﹣1．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187faf847ed06ly.png\">(1)求这个函数的表达式；(2)在给出的平面直角坐标系中，请用你喜欢的方法画出这个函数的图象并写出这个函数的一条性质；(3)已知函数y＝ $\\frac12$ x﹣3的图象如图所示，结合你所画的函数图象，直接写出不等式|kx﹣3|+b≤ $\\frac12$ x﹣3的解集．","solution":"(1)∵在函数y＝|kx﹣3|+b中，当x＝2时，y＝﹣4；当x＝0时，y＝﹣1，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafa89f306oc.png\">得<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafaa2cc06m2.png\">∴这个函数的表达式是<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafabc6706ml.png\">(2)<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafaf10206od.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafb12fe06m4.png\">∴函数<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafb845f06of.png\">过点（2，﹣4）和点（4，﹣1）；函数<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafba45606m5.png\">过点（0，﹣1）和点（﹣2，2）；该函数的图象如图所示，性质是当x＞2时，y随x的增大而增大；(3)由函数图象可得，不等式|kx﹣3|+b≤<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafbef0306mo.png\">x﹣3的解集是1≤x≤4．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187fafb639406mm.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5eb919f0eb16623401484123","knowName":"函数的图象","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExam